1) They are mortal.  Good weapons, armor, and willingness to get back
your telepathy and AC basis points are very much needed for this
approach.  A character that can take on many Kops can be creamed by a
couple of guards.  But the watch captain has a 50-50 chance of having
a silver saber.  If you just happen to bring your kitten back up from
minesend after that incident with a polymorph trap turned into into
something far stronger than a guard, so much the better.  Pet black
dragons work great.

2) Avoid angering them in the first place.

3) Lock them in rooms so they don't see you.  They'll get angry but
they don't carry keys.  They will stay locked until a digging monster
does a jailbreak for them.  Just closing the door does not work.
Getting them to move into rooms without angering them takes some
patience.

